    "cp": 1,
    "summary": "Strategic Ploy, 1 CP. Use it in any Fight phase, as soon as an enemy unit has picked its targets, on one HERETIC ASTARTES unit of yours that was chosen as a target for at least one of those attacks. Until the phase ends, whenever one of your unit's models is destroyed while it has yet to fight this phase, roll a D6 (a KHORNE unit adds 1 to it). On 4+, the model stays in play: it gets to fight once the enemy unit doing the attacking has resolved all of its attacks, then is removed.",
